  "job_C16.2_20251003_115216": {
    "chunk_text": "na god Luna XX; omnibus rebus uanissima est mona se twentigo\u00fea; eallum \u00feingum ydelust ys. Puer natus agricola; astutus cild acenned yr\u00f0lincg; gep. Puella similiter; uiros spernit m\u00e6den ealswa; weras forhoga\u00f0. Eger diu languescit; cito non surgit seoc lange adla\u00f0; ra\u00f0e na arisa\u00f0. Somnium non credendum swefen na to gelefenne. Non est bona luna sanguinem minuere nys na god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna XXI non utilis operandi, nisi gladiatoribus; & si dederis, non recipies iterum mona se Futurum cito inuenitur stalu ra\u00f0e bi\u00f0 funden. Puer natus laboriosus, misericors, litteratus, bene agens cild acenned geswicful, mildheort, Puella signum in ceruice uel in mamilla dextra; laboriosa, casta, in omnibus amata, uno uiro contenta Eger difficile euadit uel cito moritur seoc earfo\u00f0lice \u00e6twint o\u00f0\u00f0e ra\u00f0e he swylt. Somnia uacua sunt swefen ydele synt. Usque ad horam III bona est luna sanguinem minuere o\u00f0 \u00fea \u00feriddan tide god ys mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna XXII; utilis emere mancipia mona se twaandtwentigo\u00f0e; nytlice biicgan \u00feeawas. Puer natus medicus cild acenned l\u00e6ce. Puella similiter, paupercula m\u00e6den ealswa, \u00feearfena. Eger cito confortatur seoc ra\u00f0e bi\u00f0 gestrangod. Utilis est luna sanguinem minuere nytlic ys mona blod l\u00e6tan. Somnia certa erunt, si fuerint retenta in memoria swefnu gewisse beo\u00f0, gif hi beo\u00f0 ge",
